>
> Above G-VS1, the premiums are purely certificate-driven. F-VVS2 at $51,354 and F-VVS1 at $53,289 look identical to G-VS1 at $45,854 in the ring and on the hand. If your budget is $50,000+, I would apply the extra $5,000 to a platinum setting or a better band — not to a VVS clarity upgrade.

