| Natural buyer, sweet spot | 3.00ct G-VS1 GIA + Ten Prong WG = [$45,854](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29205249?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | Correct grade for natural 3ct. Every dollar above this buys certificate. |
